{"page_id": "synth_copies-images_sv29cea4a2-p1", "markdown": "# INDIAN MEDICAL ASSOCIATION (HQS.)\n\nJUNIOR DOCTORS NETWORK\n\nI.M.A. House, Indraprastha Marg, New Delhi-110 002\n\nWebsite: www.ima-india.org; www.imajdn.org Email: imaidnnational@gmail.com, IMA HQ- hsg@ima-india.org\n\nNational President\n\nDr. J.A. Jayalal\n\n(M): 9443160026îÍš\n\nEmail: lapsurgeon2001@yahoo.co.in\n\nHonorary Secretary General\n\nDr. Jayesh M. Lele\n\n(M):9819812996\n\nEmail: drjayeshlele@gmail.com\n\nSecretary\n\nIMA JDN Standing Committee\n\nDr. Parul Vedgama\n\n(M): 98795 33318\n\nEmail:drparulvadgama 1980@gmail.com\n\nIndian Medical Association\n\nNational President\n\nDr. J.A. Jayalal(Tamil Nadu)\n\nMob. 94431 60026\n\nImm. Past National President Or. Raian Sharma (Harvana)\n\nMob. 9812054730\n\nHonorary Secretary General\n\nDr. Jayesh M Lele (Maharashtra)\n\nMob: 9819812996\n\nDr. Anil Goyal (Delhi)\n\nIMA JDN STANDING COMMITTEE\n\nChairman\n\nDr. K. M Abul Hasan (Tamil Nadu)\n\nMob. 9843025300, 9443320505\n\nSecretary\n\nDr. Parul Vedgama (Gujarat)\n\nMob. 98795 33318\n\nVice Chairman\n\nDr. Anirban Dalui (Bengal)\n\nMob. 9432082978\n\nMember\n\nDr Rajiv Agarwal (Maharashtra)\n\nMob. 9324547676\n\nDr. Kannan Rajendran (Tamil Nadu)\n\nMob.9442577394\n\nDr Anil Pachnekar (Maharashtra)\n\nMob: 9869001873\n\nDr Benoy (Kerala)\n\nMob: 9447107536\n\nDr. A Manikandan Jothi Senthil (Pondicherry)\n\nIMA JON NATIONAL COUNCIL\n\nDr. Shiv Joshi (Maharashtra)\n\nMob. 9975155699\n\nNational Secretary\n\nDr Karan Juneja\n\nMob. 7017497457\n\nCo Convenon\n\nDr. Akshay Yadav (Maharashtra)\n\nMob: 9673334149\n\nDr. Aswin Surjit (Kerala)\n\nMob: 9446471672\n\nDr. Shravan Dave (Gujarat)\n\nMOD. 62U00100/0\n\nDr. Rajeev Ranjan (Bihar)\n\nMob: 8579995844\n\nJoint Secretary for HQ Liaision\n\nDr. Aravind Swamy (Delhi)\n\nNational Joint Secretaries\n\nDr Shankul Dwivedi (MP)\n\nMob. 9009664423\n\nDr Manikandhan (Tamil Nadu)\n\nDr Tanveer Dahiya (Punjab)\n\nMob. 7696008229\n\nDr Krishan Kant (Haryana)\n\nMob 8700084645\n\nNational Convenor\n\nIMA JDN National Council\n\nDr. Shiv Joshi\n\n(M):9975155699, 9326804516\n\nEmail: drshivjoshi93@gmail.com\n\nChairman\n\nIMA JDN Standing Committee\n\nDr. K. M. Abul Hasan\n\n(M):9843025300,9443320505\n\nEmail: drkmabulhasan@yahco.com\n\nNational Secretary\n\nIMA JDN National Council\n\nDr. Karan Juneja\n\n(M): 7017497457\n\nEmail: junejakaran@yahoo.com\n\n31.05.2021\n\nPress Release\n\nThe modern medicine doctors have been fighting upfront during the\n\nCOVID 19 pandemic and we have not backed out even after seeing our colleagues getting infected and getting infected ourselves.\n\nIndian Medical Association Junior Doctors' Network condemns the insulting remarks made by Mr Ram Krishna Yadav alias Baba Ramdev and declare a Nationwide Black Day Protest on 1st June 2021 without hampering the patient care to voice our protest against such derogatory comments made on our profession.\n\nWe also support all the RDAs at the National and the state levels who have come together to demonstrate their anguish through a black day protest.\n\nThanking You\n\nYours Sincerely\n\nDr KM Abul Hasan\n\nChairman, IMA JDN Standing Committee\n\nDr. Parul Vedgama\n\nSecretary, IMA JDN Standing Committee\n\nDr Shiv Joshi\n\nConvener IMA JDN, National Council\n\nDr Karan Juneja\n\nSecretary, IMA JDN, National Council", "width": 1654, "height": 2340, "blocks": [{"kind": "heading", "text": "INDIAN MEDICAL ASSOCIATION (HQS.)", "bbox": {"x": 282.15294090878945, "y": 58.49999998530153, "width": 1143.2058823529412, "height": 58.50000000000005}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "JUNIOR DOCTORS NETWORK", "bbox": {"x": 408.63529387441184, "y": 126.74999998630616, "width": 885.3764705882353, "height": 48.750000000000085}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "I.M.A. House, Indraprastha Marg, New Delhi-110 002", "bbox": {"x": 617.8176468155883, "y": 190.12499999017137, "width": 603.2235294117647, "height": 24.374999999999915}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Website: www.ima-india.