xt", "text": "Email: junejakaran@yahoo.com", "bbox": {"x": 1148.0705878564086, "y": 609.3749999718751, "width": 394.0411764705883, "height": 29.249999999999897}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "31.05.2021", "bbox": {"x": 1371.8470585802938, "y": 740.9999999582145, "width": 170.26470588235307, "height": 29.249999999999897}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Press Release", "bbox": {"x": 870.1659693068043, "y": 864.9674434554097, "width": 341.8761208478142, "height": 56.87049651145921}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "The modern medicine doctors have been fighting upfront during the", "bbox": {"x": 471.876470338627, "y": 1009.1249999925492, "width": 1143.2058823529412, "height": 34.12499999999988}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "COVID 19 pandemic and we have not backed out even after seeing our colleagues getting infected and getting infected ourselves.", "bbox": {"x": 471.8764702750477, "y": 1052.9999999875376, "width": 1143.2058823529412, "height": 87.75000000000021}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Indian Medical Association Junior Doctors' Network condemns the insulting remarks made by Mr Ram Krishna Yadav alias Baba Ramdev and declare a Nationwide Black Day Protest on 1st June 2021 without hampering the patient care to voice our protest against such derogatory comments made on our profession.", "bbox": {"x": 466.76482248380603, "y": 1188.3271517934404, "width": 1153.325073331945, "height": 245.6899745464326}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "We also support all the RDAs at the National and the state levels who have come together to demonstrate their anguish through a black day protest.", "bbox": {"x": 466.6767666283982, "y": 1479.0694516074602, "width": 1148.641042103487, "height": 137.64089047908766}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Thanking You", "bbox": {"x": 928.9882716542454, "y": 1666.4336349206033, "width": 228.98227967654958, "height": 50.38273000717158}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Yours Sincerely", "bbox": {"x": 913.8309579423309, "y": 1754.4595090994148, "width": 263.8636965358958, "height": 57.19564729928956}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Dr KM Abul Hasan", "bbox": {"x": 559.4411761868138, "y": 1964.6249999675001, "width": 379.44705882352935, "height": 39.00000000000012}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Chairman, IMA JDN Standing Committee", "bbox": {"x": 491.3352938969336, "y": 2003.624999959375, "width": 530.2529411764706, "height": 43.87500000000011}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Dr. Parul Vedgama", "bbox": {"x": 1142.4060050689084, "y": 1957.7238606971202, "width": 361.48459109138054, "height": 57.77668333053594}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Secretary, IMA JDN Standing Committee", "bbox": {"x": 1060.505882112379, "y": 2003.624999975893, "width": 525.3882352941176, "height": 43.874999999999844}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Dr Shiv Joshi", "bbox": {"x": 632.4117645394582, "y": 2159.62499994227, "width": 252.96470588235297, "height": 43.87500000000011}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Convener IMA JDN, National Council", "bbox": {"x": 515.6588233899092, "y": 2203.499999971323, "width": 481.6058823529413, "height": 39.00000000000012}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Dr Karan Juneja", "bbox": {"x": 1166.7971191989352, "y": 2157.879718650094, "width": 317.59256403305943, "height": 51.50324320793157}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Secretary, IMA JDN, National Council", "bbox": {"x": 1084.8294115214703, "y": 2203.499999977841, "width": 481.60588235294114, "height": 43.87500000000011}}], "ms": 404.454542}